            <profile id="b0eb-2ec4-2b4e-4e83" name="Equipment and options (as printed in WAB2 army list)" publicationId="aab0-aa1e-0319-4ffe" hidden="false" typeId="b19e-ee0c-17d1-6e33" typeName="Equipment and Notes">
              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Text" typeId="63ac-8f60-d28a-2232">Sword, kontos, shield and light armour; barded horses (included in the points). May have javelins (+1 pt), darts (+1 pt), short bow (+1 pt), heavy armour (+2 pts). Cataphracts: count rank bonus up to +3 and may not march (see Cataphract list). Cataphract values as printed in the Late Roman list. (Armies of Antiquity p.25)</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
            </profile>
            <profile id="5a27-c721-f56d-70c3" name="Armour Save" hidden="false" typeId="0dbe-f4ed-ef08-8e86" typeName="Armour Save">
