              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Text" typeId="63ac-8f60-d28a-2232">Sword and javelins. May have buckler or shield (+1 pt), throwing spear (+1 pt), darts (+1 pt). May replace javelins with sling (free), bow (+1 pt) or crossbow/staff sling (+2 pts; both count as crossbows). Skirmishers. (Armies of Antiquity p.25)</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
            </profile>
